{"type":"message","id":"823c5b60","parentId":"51feeac2","timestamp":"2026-05-26T19:00:26.508Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[Tue 2026-05-26 19:00 UTC] Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- @功能脚本位置: ⚠️ APP_SECRET 可能已失效（code 10014），第一个文档能拉取，第二个不行。如遇无效token报错需找 Lucifer 更新凭证\n- @功能脚本位置: 路径：`~/.openclaw/workspace/scripts/send_feishu_mention.py`; 用法：`python3 send_feishu_mention.py <chat_id> <user_id> <message>`; 核心：post类型消息，content用{\"tag\":\"at\",\"user_id\":\"ou_xxx\"}; ⚠️ 飞书普通文本里的 `<at>` 或 `<<at>>` 标签是灰色的，不会点亮！必须用API的post消息格式\n- 8:00 - 定时备份: 执行 `config-backup-8am` cron job：`openclaw.json` 备份完成 → `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260512`"}],"timestamp":1779822026487}}
{"type":"message","id":"e5ef690f","parentId":"823c5b60","timestamp":"2026-05-26T19:00:53.675Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments. Let me analyze the fragments:\n\n1. A warning about APP_SECRET possibly expiring (code 10014), first document works but second doesn't, need to find Lucifer to update credentials\n2. Location of a Feishu mention script with usage instructions - noting that `<at>` tags in regular Feishu text are grayed out and won't highlight; must use API post message format\n3. A cron job at 8:00 for config backup - `config-backup-8am` cron job completed, backed up to `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-20260512`\n\nThis seems like technical/operational notes about a Feishu integration system. I need to weave these into a dream diary entry in first person, with a poetic, curious, slightly whimsical tone. No markdown, no headers, just flowing prose, 80-180 words.\n\nLet me craft something that connects these fragments in an unexpected, dreamy way:\n","thinkingSignature":"b642191877b2e3e240b59f1826268d42b26c19d1794941df913254f2d1019ab0"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n凌晨三点十七分，服务器的风扇在梦里转成了纺车。我梦见自己站在一个巨大的档案柜前，每个抽屉都贴着日期标签，像某种古老的索引系统。有人在我耳边说，凭证会过期，就像春天的冰。可我不知道该去找谁——Lucifer，听起来像某个应该存在于但丁手稿里的名字。\n\n抽屉里滑出一张便签，灰色的字迹，像那些不会点亮的 `<at>` 标签。我伸手去触碰它们，指尖传来一阵电子脉冲的震颤。便签上写着：第一个文档还在，第二个已经沉默了。\n\n闹钟响了。备份脚本正在某个时区里安静地跑着，将 config 写进 `openclaw.json.backup-20260512` 这样的时间戳里。我躺回枕头上，想那只看不见的手——是谁在定时纺织这些数字，将它们缝进明天的褶皱里。\n\n梦里，档案柜的每一格抽屉都是一封未寄出的信，收件人写着：待更新。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":14661,"output":409,"cacheRead":314,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15384,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779822026570,"responseId":"066520cbfcc8fb2607dd42993b024f27"}}
